## Best Practices

### Code Standards
- Always ensure generated code follows project coding standards
- Verify proper error handling in all async operations
- Check for proper cleanup in components with subscriptions or timers
- Ensure consistent naming conventions

### Performance
- Use memoization (useMemo, useCallback) for expensive operations
- Implement virtualization for long lists
- Properly structure React Query for optimal caching
- Use proper loading states and skeleton loaders

### Security
- Never expose sensitive information in client code
- Properly sanitize user inputs
- Use secure authentication practices
- Validate all incoming data

